{"script":"yd_023_07","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1","mirrow":false,"x":330,"trans":false,"y":14,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1a","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":0,"x":330,"trans":false,"y":14,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"timeBak":300,"addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1a","nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]我小时候经常饿肚子。所以我想了很久，有没有绝对不会饿肚子的方法。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]我想到的答案就是——不挑食！有食物的时候就吃到饱，没有食物的话，落叶杂草，甚至树皮草根都是可以暂时充饥的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]只要先把肚子填饱，就有力气做事，不管是去更远的地方找食物还是别的什么。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":0,"x":330,"trans":false,"y":14,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"timeBak":300,"addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1a","nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"卡夫-绝对不会饿肚子的方法"}